52, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ano_ko/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 492951, "client_id": 725435, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/249af0f2/uploads/origins/55323a72-9a5c-41f1-80ff-a64e04322f51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a497a3610335fc4fbf136de70c75dd6b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/249af0f2/uploads/origins/55323a72-9a5c-41f1-80ff-a64e04322f51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=16c9fe849a433563e135cf6267343423", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お世話になりますー！\n\nアイコンお願いします。\n黒猫ちゃんの令和6年度バージョンです。\n\n今までのアイコンの女の子\n麦わら帽子をかぶっている\n目は隠れている\n夏野菜をかごの中に入れたものを持っている\n黒猫要素が欲しい🐈‍⬛\n\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ano_ko/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 492951, "client_id": 2917062, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/84fcc3d4/uploads/origins/5f2ea57f-0508-434f-b79b-b68f9287023e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0ae0aaa0a0c19291216bac2ca4c16ef", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/84fcc3d4/uploads/origins/5f2ea57f-0508-434f-b79b-b68f9287023e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5967322f490c38ab93a5b97c9dd348fb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お世話様です、突然ですがあの子さんの描くうちの子が猛烈に見たくなったので失礼しますねっ\n\nゲーセンデートな